    "title": "Michigan lottery results",
    "description": "Protect yourself and others - check your tickets on the app. You no longer need to waste time in queues at retailers just to verify your winnings. \r\n\r\n\u2b55 Get instant notifications of results the moment draw is complete. \r\n\u2b55 Quick access to draw history of last 500 games.\r\n\u2b55 Easily generate new numbers for future games.\r\n\u2b55 Optimised for low data usage. \r\n\r\nSupported games:\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f Daily 3\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f Daily 4\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f Fantasy 5\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f Lotto 47\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f Powerball\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f Mega Millions\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f Lucky for Life\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nImportant: This app does not allow you to purchase lottery tickets or place bets and is for informational purposes only.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Please check your ticket at an official outlet before discarding. We cannot guarantee the accuracy of the results provided. Errors or omissions may occur.",
